 From  - ls -al /dev/nvidia*

We need

crw-rw-rw- 1 root root 195,   0 Jun  9 07:33 /dev/nvidia0
crw-rw-rw- 1 root root 195, 255 Jun  9 07:33 /dev/nvidiactl
crw-rw-rw- 1 root root 505,   0 Jun  9 07:33 /dev/nvidia-uvm
crw-rw-rw- 1 root root 505,   1 Jun  9 07:33 /dev/nvidia-uvm-tools

/dev/nvidia-caps:
total 0
drwxr-xr-x  2 root root     80 Jun  9 07:33 .
drwxr-xr-x 21 root root   4940 Jun  9 07:33 ..
cr--------  1 root root 508, 1 Jun  9 07:33 nvidia-cap1
cr--r--r--  1 root root 508, 2 Jun  9 07:33 nvidia-cap2

195,505,508

So (tailscale inc)

lxc.cgroup2.devices.allow: c 195:* rwm
lxc.cgroup2.devices.allow: c 505:* rwm
lxc.cgroup2.devices.allow: c 508:* rwm
lxc.mount.entry: /dev/nvidia0 dev/nvidia0 none bind,optional,create=file
lxc.mount.entry: /dev/nvidiactl dev/nvidiactl none bind,optional,create=file
lxc.mount.entry: /dev/nvidia-modeset dev/nvidia-modeset none bind,optional,create=file
lxc.cgroup2.devices.allow: c 10:200 rwm
lxc.mount.entry: /dev/net/tun dev/net/tun none bind,create=file

